  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <ul>\n• <li>Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. </li>\n• <li>Cut potato into fries and place on the lined oven tray. </li>\n• <li>Season with salt and drizzle with olive oil. </li>\n• <li>Toss to coat and bake until tender, 20-25 mins. </li>\n• </ul>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69cb2030591ea8bdcc9dd14e/step-f91f5100.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <ul>\n• <li>Thinly slice brown onion. </li>\n• <li>In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. </li>\n• <li>Cook onion, stirring, until softened, 5-6 mins. Reduce heat to medium.</li>\n• <li>Stir in the balsamic vinegar, brown sugar and splash of water. Cook until dark and sticky, 3-5 mins. Transfer to a bowl and set aside.</li>\n• </ul>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69cb2030591ea8bdcc9dd14e/step-9295fe10.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <ul>\n• <li>When the fries have 10 mins remaining, pat haloumi dry, then slice horizontally  to get 1 piece per person.</li>\n• <li>Return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. </li>\n• <li>Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 mins each side.</li>\n• </ul>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69cb2030591ea8bdcc9dd14e/step-14439520.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <ul>\n• <li>Halve continental rolls and bake directly on a wire oven rack until heated through, 2-3 mins. </li>\n• <li>Spread the mayonnaise and basil pesto on the roll bases, then top with haloumi, caramelised onion and salad leaves. </li>\n• <li>Serve with fries.</li>\n• </ul>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69cb2030591ea8bdcc9dd14e/step-f91f4130.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
